# File: scripts/__tests__/nmg-sdlc-smoke.test.mjs
# Generated from: specs/473-fix-smoke-provisioning-prompting-through-a-workspace-trust-dialog-herdr-reports-as-ready/requirements.md
Feature: Fix smoke provisioning prompting through a workspace-trust dialog Herdr reports as ready

  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: A trust dialog behind a ready agent is accepted before prompting
    Given "herdr agent start" succeeds and every "agent get" reports interactive_ready
    And the provisioning pane shows the narrow, wrapped workspace-trust dialog
    When the provider waits for readiness
    Then it sends "down enter" once
    And "/sdlc-draft-issue" is sent only after the dialog is gone

  @SCN002 @regression
  Scenario: Wrapped dialog text is recognized
    Given the narrow-pane trust capture with "Yes, I trust this" and "folder" on separate lines
    When claudeDialog classifies it
    Then the kind is "workspace_trust"

  @SCN003
  Scenario: Ordinary readiness is unchanged
    Given a ready agent with no dialog on screen
    When the provider waits for readiness
    Then it prompts without sending keys
